WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.062
Parliamentary Testimony They Ignored.

00:00:03.012 --> 00:00:05.550
The government heard the warnings.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:08.000
They are preserved in Hansard.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.962
Disability organizations, human rights bodies, and expert witnesses testified before the Standing Committee on Justice.

00:00:15.962 --> 00:00:18.750
Their testimony is public record.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:21.562
The government proceeded regardless.
